s=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/27/288180982/c5387ee7cdc52c9fbc45c5c48ac84256_3281622887953319472.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e喜欢记录的月灵\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"任务地点\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e挪德卡莱·银月之庭\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e新月总是静静聆听着众生的心愿，无论欢笑或泪水，幸福或悲伤。既然如此，新月又是否有过只属于自己的心愿呢？\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8824","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":true,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":true},{"name":"相关成就","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"header\":[\"成就名称\",\"完成条件\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"506867\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/26/76362111/1f504de7c079af27bbb79340b49eb37c_5718506711472994040.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"今夜月色正好\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506867/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506867/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/26/76362111/1f504de7c079af27bbb79340b49eb37c_5718506711472994040.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e今夜月色正好\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e完成「伴月纪闻·其一」。\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"507314\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/26/76362111/1f504de7c079af27bbb79340b49eb37c_5718506711472994040.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"金之旅人、银之月\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/507314/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/507314/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/26/76362111/1f504de7c079af27bbb79340b49eb37c_5718506711472994040.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e金之旅人、银之月\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e完成「伴月纪闻·其二」。\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"507794\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/26/76362111/1f504de7c079af27bbb79340b49eb37c_5718506711472994040.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"月的白夜歌\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/507794/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/507794/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/26/76362111/1f504de7c079af27bbb79340b49eb37c_5718506711472994040.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e月的白夜歌\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e完成「伴月纪闻·其三」。\u003c/p\u003e\"]]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8830","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":true,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"在银月之庭与「少女」的互动","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"thbxm5g7mmhT1761577230434\",\"child_ids\":{\"luyow7k0127T1761579772625\":[],\"thbxm5g7mmhT1761577230434\":[\"luyow7k0127T1761579772625\"]},\"contents\":{\"luyow7k0127T1761579772625\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e听完了就去睡觉，不然你们要吵醒那只巨鲸了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e月灵们都很活泼，哄它们睡觉有时很不容易。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【少女】\"},\"thbxm5g7mmhT1761577230434\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…凶猛的海浪拍打着孤岛，几百年从未间断。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e一只好奇的鸟儿顶着狂风，来到了风暴中心。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e原来翻涌的波涛，全都来自于一只巨鲸打出的呼噜。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e于是鸟儿给它讲了个安睡的故事，从此大海便安静了下来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"xgdkekl40gT1761579820214\",\"child_ids\":{\"pg11785virpT1761580004777\":[],\"xgdkekl40gT1761579820214\":[\"pg11785virpT1761580004777\"]},\"contents\":{\"pg11785virpT1761580004777\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你也要听故事吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e小心别被虚假的月亮骗了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【少女】\"},\"xgdkekl40gT1761579820214\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…从前，森林里有一汪倒映着月亮的湖水，小动物们都喜欢来这里喝水。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e湖水如此清澈，以至于低头喝水的小动物，都以为眼前的就是真实的月亮。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e而当它们伸手去捞月亮的时候，月亮却永远地破碎了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"veumqbouzdlT1761580040301\",\"child_ids\":{\"nlnh3ih8z4lT1761580129648\":[],\"veumqbouzdlT1761580040301\":[\"nlnh3ih8z4lT1761580129648\"]},\"contents\":{\"nlnh3ih8z4lT1761580129648\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【（她好像在休息，还是不要打扰她了吧…）】\"},\"veumqbouzdlT1761580040301\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e……\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"1q2xd4cvh3pT1761580158855\",\"child_ids\":{\"1q2xd4cvh3pT1761580158855\":[]},\"contents\":{\"1q2xd4cvh3pT1761580158855\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘘……\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e它们睡着了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"2r1apunbms6T1761580314825\",\"child_ids\":{\"2r1apunbms6T1761580314825\":[]},\"contents\":{\"2r1apunbms6T1761580314825\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你好像很累的样子，是这里太高了？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔…是不是搭个梯子比较好？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"cz2jrc9rq3T1761580358412\",\"child_ids\":{\"cz2jrc9rq3T1761580358412\":[]},\"contents\":{\"cz2jrc9rq3T1761580358412\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我喜欢高处。你说…如果在高高的月亮上看提瓦特，会是什么样？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"qoa0pv3eteT1761580433088\",\"child_ids\":{\"qoa0pv3eteT1761580433088\":[\"t5cp3o9sdqT1761580473616\"],\"t5cp3o9sdqT1761580473616\":[]},\"contents\":{\"qoa0pv3eteT1761580433088\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e在找我？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"t5cp3o9sdqT1761580473616\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e被吓到了？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【少女】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"2zv70ob6wtxT1761580506897\",\"child_ids\":{\"2zv70ob6wtxT1761580506897\":[\"mep419uehkrT1761580522424\"],\"mep419uehkrT1761580522424\":[]},\"contents\":{\"2zv70ob6wtxT1761580506897\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e在找我？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"mep419uehkrT1761580522424\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿蕾奇诺以前经常和我玩这个游戏，但我只赢过一次。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔…有机会再找她试试。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【少女】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"61gf5nma4cT1761580566843\",\"child_ids\":{\"61gf5nma4cT1761580566843\":[\"y873eymr1woT1761580579690\"],\"y873eymr1woT1761580579690\":[]},\"contents\":{\"61gf5nma4cT1761580566843\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e在找我？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"y873eymr1woT1761580579690\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e试着感知月矩力，说不定下次能提前发现我。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【少女】\"}}},{\"root_id\":\"bvuwtsi4n7dT1761580620433\",\"child_ids\":{\"bvuwtsi4n7dT1761580620433\":[\"lrotan1b43dT1761580662654\"],\"lrotan1b43dT1761580662654\":[]},\"contents\":{\"bvuwtsi4n7dT1761580620433\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…就像跷跷板一样。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果这边拿了东西，而不在那边放点什么的话…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e跷跷板就会翻掉了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"lrotan1b43dT1761580662654\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e经常有人给月灵一些东西，祈求好运。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我在告诉它们要懂得「回报」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【少女】\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8831","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":true,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"玩法教学","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/27/288180982/4ee23a958b41aac928d8bdc837d17ee9_4712736221183160746.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"778\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 778px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/27/288180982/4ee23a958b41aac928d8bdc837d17ee9_4712736221183160746.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 778px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e每隔一段时间，可以前往银月之庭，与「少女」见面。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/27/288180982/ba0ae69811264b713a97130bf155b110_6544340484501052717.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"775\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 775px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/27/288180982/ba0ae69811264b713a97130bf155b110_6544340484501052717.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 775px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e完成任务后的一段时间内，队伍将获得「新月之拥」效果：处于挪德卡莱区域时，队伍的月兆等级将始终为满辉。此外，完成一定数量的任务后，还可以获得各种各样的奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_sw